It's basically a subscription box that puts
you in the center of a new horror mystery

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:03.520
taking place in the universe of one of the
greatest found-footage movies of all time:

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.629
The Blair Witch Project.

00:06:04.629 --> 00:06:06.460
Each season consists of 6 episodes.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:09.790
When you open the box you'll receive your
case file, which consists of realistic evidence,

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:13.160
we're talking journals, police reports, maps
and other documents that will help you solve

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.669
the mystery of Black Hills Forest.

00:06:14.669 --> 00:06:18.180
If I could compare to anything, I'd say it
really has the feeling of an escape room.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.629
It's very hands on, and it makes you a character
in the story.

00:06:20.629 --> 00:06:24.980
There are certain parts where you make a revelation,
that's genuinely just creepy and unsettling.

